---
description: Route Arduino and embedded work through the shared skills tree with board-aware and evidence-aware constraints.
globs:
  - "**/*.ino"
  - "**/*.cpp"
  - "**/*.h"
alwaysApply: false
---

Use the canonical `skills/` source. For physical or multi-session work, start
with `skills/embedded-project-loop/SKILL.md`, then use the workflow router for
combined work; otherwise load the narrowest matching skill. Confirm the exact board,
framework, toolchain, pins, voltage, current, memory, and library versions.
Keep build, upload, hardware, system, and deployment proof separate. Never
invent physical measurements or flashing results.
